xt":"特技はキックボクシング。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13224","sourceWorkId":"24426","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"哲生の大親友。 再会後もお互いの考えていることは大体分かるほどの相性の良さ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学業・私生活ともに優等生で、母の経営する喫茶店の手伝いもしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"哲生と同じように前向きでポジティブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朗らかな人柄だが、身内に対してはだらしないところも見せる。 隠れ巨乳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技はキックボクシング。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふん、10年ぶりに再会した親友の成長した姿に一目惚れしちゃった？　なーんてね――　おい、今なんて言った」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48147"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13224","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13224","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13224","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13224","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13224","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/2153a311ad1dc75db02c0e14a5c1309824362d809c14893ead376d4b104e281d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b46ee84d0852e632c9c40cd164bb10396762f5bcc7e43fd01b15d8eba96b62a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"種﨑敦美","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:196865:48147:7575:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55867","characterName":"星井 青香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48148","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"196865"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13225"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55867"},"originalCharacterName":"星井 青香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seika is Izana's best female friend and more than a little bit prickly toward anyone who approaches her with ulterior motives (and because of Izana's easy manner and physical beauty, that is pretty common. She was raised by a strict father who sees her only as a convenient object to augment his own ambitions for the family line, which is a lot of the reason why she is so prickly in general. Her sole point of softness is Izana, whom she would probably do anything for."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Fuwanovel"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55867"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名士である星井家の次女で、哲生がいなくなった後のいざなの１番の友人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道を絵に描いたような人間で自分に厳しく、だらしない人間を容赦なく斬り捨てる排他的な所もあるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いざなに恩義を感じていて、下心で近寄ろうとする人間を男女の区別無くはねのけてきた彼女の騎士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巨乳で自覚もあるが恋愛には興味が無い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13225","sourceWorkId":"24426","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名士である星井家の次女で、哲生がいなくなった後の いざなの 1番の友人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道を体現した人物で自分に厳しく、だらしない人間を容赦なく斬り捨てる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いざなに恩義を感じていて、下心で近寄る人間を男女問わず跳ね除けてきた騎士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巨乳で自覚もあるが、恋愛には興味が無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「どこの馬の骨か分からないような男を、いざなに近づけさせられるわけが無いでしょう？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48148"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13225","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13225","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13225","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13225","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13225","sourceWorkId":"24426","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97efff42fc22ff44a8ee9816c9d537b4947047553d5603d37416606b665129ff.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f3618d5ffae227eb336e4862c64497509818f78b38a8259150b15502d1777c2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本多真梨子","creatorId":"vndb:s5178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5178","name":"本多真梨子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:196865:48148:5203:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55868","characterName":"阿見 マリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48149","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"196865"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13226"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55868"},"originalCharacterName":"阿見 マリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus